WEBVTT

1
00:00:28.708 --> 00:00:31.541
In verse 17.4, Lord Krishna carries forward

2
00:00:31.541 --> 00:00:33.875
the principle explained earlier,

3
00:00:33.875 --> 00:00:37.583
clarifying that faith arises

4
00:00:37.583 --> 00:00:41.541
from a person's nature and gunas.

5
00:00:41.541 --> 00:00:43.250
Now He explains that

6
00:00:43.250 --> 00:00:46.958
this faith does not remain only an inner feeling,

7
00:00:46.958 --> 00:00:48.125
but also manifests

8
00:00:48.125 --> 00:00:52.000
in the form of different kinds of worship.

9
00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:53.083
Every being

10
00:00:53.083 --> 00:00:56.333
is born with some faith,

11
00:00:56.333 --> 00:00:59.958
but the worship of all is not the same.

12
00:00:59.958 --> 00:01:03.166
Whichever guna has more influence
on the mind –

13
00:01:03.166 --> 00:01:05.333
sattva, rajas, or tamas –

14
00:01:05.333 --> 00:01:07.666
accordingly a person leans

15
00:01:07.666 --> 00:01:13.791
toward particular deities or
different kinds of spiritual practices.

16
00:01:18.541 --> 00:01:20.416
Lord Krishna explains –

17
00:01:20.416 --> 00:01:23.375
whatever a person worships

18
00:01:23.375 --> 00:01:25.708
is a direct reflection of the gunas

19
00:01:25.708 --> 00:01:28.166
and nature within them.

20
00:01:28.166 --> 00:01:30.375
People influenced by sattva-guna

21
00:01:30.375 --> 00:01:32.666
worship the gods –

22
00:01:32.666 --> 00:01:35.833
such as Indra, Surya, or Agni –

23
00:01:35.833 --> 00:01:39.250
who are the protectors of the cosmic order

24
00:01:39.250 --> 00:01:42.208
and represent higher qualities.

25
00:01:42.208 --> 00:01:45.125
Their devotion is filled with discipline, purity,

26
00:01:45.125 --> 00:01:48.333
and harmony.

27
00:01:48.333 --> 00:01:50.375
People influenced by rajo-guna

28
00:01:50.375 --> 00:01:53.583
are attracted toward powerful
but materialistic beings –

29
00:01:53.583 --> 00:01:57.166
the yakshas and rakshasas.

30
00:01:57.166 --> 00:02:00.333
The yakshas, being connected to Kubera,

31
00:02:00.333 --> 00:02:02.250
are symbols of wealth and opulence,

32
00:02:02.250 --> 00:02:03.708
and the rakshasas

33
00:02:03.708 --> 00:02:07.375
are known for strength, dominance,
and aggression.

34
00:02:07.375 --> 00:02:09.166
The aim of such worship

35
00:02:09.166 --> 00:02:11.083
is often to obtain personal gain –

36
00:02:11.083 --> 00:02:15.125
wealth, fame, or influence.

37
00:02:15.125 --> 00:02:19.416
It is shallow and lacking in depth.

38
00:02:19.416 --> 00:02:21.250
People covered by tamo-guna,

39
00:02:21.250 --> 00:02:24.708
entangled in fear and superstition,
worship ghosts,

40
00:02:24.708 --> 00:02:25.375
spirits,

41
00:02:25.375 --> 00:02:28.833
or unseen forces.

42
00:02:28.833 --> 00:02:33.000
This worship is neither based
on clear knowledge,

43
00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:35.791
nor does it lift the soul higher.

44
00:02:35.791 --> 00:02:38.208
Often it takes the form of dark practices

45
00:02:38.208 --> 00:02:41.541
or tamasic sacrifices.

46
00:02:41.541 --> 00:02:42.625
Lord Krishna

47
00:02:42.625 --> 00:02:45.708
is not merely classifying here.

48
00:02:45.708 --> 00:02:48.333
Rather He is also showing

49
00:02:48.333 --> 00:02:52.875
that not every form of worship lifts
the soul higher.

50
00:02:52.875 --> 00:02:55.125
If faith is without scripture

51
00:02:55.125 --> 00:02:57.166
and right guidance,

52
00:02:57.166 --> 00:03:00.083
then however sincere it may appear,

53
00:03:00.083 --> 00:03:03.791
it binds the seeker in the lower gunas.

54
00:03:03.791 --> 00:03:05.375
True spiritual progress

55
00:03:05.375 --> 00:03:08.375
depends not only on the intensity of faith,

56
00:03:08.375 --> 00:03:10.666
but on its direction and its connection

57
00:03:10.666 --> 00:03:12.583
with truth.

58
00:03:12.583 --> 00:03:15.125
And this change is possible.

59
00:03:15.125 --> 00:03:19.791
When the seeker takes the support of
the company of saints and scripture.

60
00:03:19.791 --> 00:03:20.958
Ultimately, the purpose

61
00:03:20.958 --> 00:03:22.750
is not merely to worship,

62
00:03:22.750 --> 00:03:25.083
but to perform such worship

63
00:03:25.083 --> 00:03:28.333
that purifies the soul, connects it with

64
00:03:28.333 --> 00:03:31.666
the Supreme essence, and frees it from materiality.

65
00:03:31.666 --> 00:03:33.375
And this is possible only

66
00:03:33.375 --> 00:03:36.541
when worship is directed not by being

67
00:03:36.541 --> 00:03:41.666
driven by the gunas, but toward moving toward
the Supreme Truth – Lord Krishna.

68
00:03:46.375 --> 00:03:50.333
Pause for a few moments and think –

69
00:03:50.333 --> 00:03:51.916
toward what does your mind

70
00:03:51.916 --> 00:03:56.208
naturally feel drawn?

71
00:03:56.208 --> 00:03:58.666
Whom do you admire,

72
00:03:58.666 --> 00:04:01.625
whom do you worship, or for whom

73
00:04:01.625 --> 00:04:04.833
do you keep striving constantly?

74
00:04:04.833 --> 00:04:08.625
It could be a person, a goal,

75
00:04:08.625 --> 00:04:13.083
a symbol, or even

76
00:04:13.083 --> 00:04:15.666
a feeling.

77
00:04:15.666 --> 00:04:17.708
Remember –

78
00:04:17.708 --> 00:04:21.791
this attraction is not by chance.

79
00:04:21.791 --> 00:04:25.625
It reveals the state of your inner being.

80
00:04:25.625 --> 00:04:29.208
If your attraction is toward light,

81
00:04:29.208 --> 00:04:32.500
truth, and compassion,

82
00:04:32.500 --> 00:04:38.666
then understand that sattva-guna
is growing within you.

83
00:04:38.666 --> 00:04:43.458
But if your desires revolve around
control, recognition,

84
00:04:43.458 --> 00:04:46.791
or fear,

85
00:04:46.791 --> 00:04:50.500
then know that rajas or tamas

86
00:04:50.500 --> 00:04:53.916
is deciding the direction within you.

87
00:04:53.916 --> 00:04:57.708
This is not a matter for guilt,

88
00:04:57.708 --> 00:05:01.625
but an opportunity to become aware.

89
00:05:01.625 --> 00:05:04.916
When you look with sincerity

90
00:05:04.916 --> 00:05:06.583
at which direction

91
00:05:06.583 --> 00:05:08.916
your faith is flowing,

92
00:05:08.916 --> 00:05:14.083
only then do you begin to understand
your life's journey.

93
00:05:14.083 --> 00:05:18.666
I am not telling you to suppress your devotion.

94
00:05:18.666 --> 00:05:23.666
I am telling you to refine it.

95
00:05:23.666 --> 00:05:27.500
Elevation begins when worship is done

96
00:05:27.500 --> 00:05:28.875
not merely from impulse,

97
00:05:28.875 --> 00:05:32.125
but from awareness.

98
00:05:32.125 --> 00:05:36.625
Do not leave your faith to attraction alone.

99
00:05:36.625 --> 00:05:40.583
Give it the support of discernment
and understanding.

100
00:05:40.583 --> 00:05:44.750
Because whatever you worship,

101
00:05:44.750 --> 00:05:49.333
it becomes the real dwelling place of your heart.

102
00:05:54.083 --> 00:05:56.583
In many homes, faith

103
00:05:56.583 --> 00:05:59.375
is inherited like the household items –

104
00:05:59.375 --> 00:06:00.958
the bed, the chair,

105
00:06:00.958 --> 00:06:03.333
the utensils –

106
00:06:03.333 --> 00:06:07.250
used every day, but rarely

107
00:06:07.250 --> 00:06:12.291
is it asked why it is there? What is it for?

108
00:06:12.291 --> 00:06:15.666
Often this faith is based not on love

109
00:06:15.666 --> 00:06:21.083
and understanding, but on fear –

110
00:06:21.083 --> 00:06:25.583
the fear of misfortune, the fear
of divine punishment,

111
00:06:25.583 --> 00:06:29.375
or the worry of escaping unseen forces.

112
00:06:29.375 --> 00:06:32.333
Think – such fear-based worship

113
00:06:32.333 --> 00:06:34.416
affects not only you,

114
00:06:34.416 --> 00:06:37.291
but your children too.

115
00:06:37.291 --> 00:06:38.750
When they see

116
00:06:38.750 --> 00:06:42.541
that rituals are done only in outer form,

117
00:06:42.541 --> 00:06:44.541
or that superstitions

118
00:06:44.541 --> 00:06:48.666
are adopted without thinking, then growing up

119
00:06:48.666 --> 00:06:50.208
they become confused –

120
00:06:50.208 --> 00:06:53.083
either they hold on to that same fear,

121
00:06:53.083 --> 00:06:56.625
or they move away from faith entirely.

122
00:06:56.625 --> 00:07:01.333
I am not telling you to abandon tradition.

123
00:07:01.333 --> 00:07:07.666
I am inviting you to transform it.

124
00:07:07.666 --> 00:07:09.208
The worship in the home

125
00:07:09.208 --> 00:07:13.833
should become a source of peace,
not of pressure.

126
00:07:13.833 --> 00:07:17.708
Instead of saying ‘do this or something
bad will happen,’

127
00:07:17.708 --> 00:07:19.958
explain to children –

128
00:07:19.958 --> 00:07:22.625
‘why we perform this ritual.’

129
00:07:22.625 --> 00:07:25.208
The evening aarti done together

130
00:07:25.208 --> 00:07:26.666
as a family

131
00:07:26.666 --> 00:07:30.166
is not only a religious tradition,

132
00:07:30.166 --> 00:07:33.666
but also an occasion for the whole family

133
00:07:33.666 --> 00:07:37.083
to come together.

134
00:07:37.083 --> 00:07:40.291
In this life of rush and hurry, this coming

135
00:07:40.291 --> 00:07:43.666
together increases mutual love.

136
00:07:43.666 --> 00:07:45.958
It keeps the whole family united.

137
00:07:45.958 --> 00:07:48.541
Add joy to your rituals,

138
00:07:48.541 --> 00:07:50.833
and awaken curiosity

139
00:07:50.833 --> 00:07:53.083
and understanding in your samskaras.

140
00:07:53.083 --> 00:07:54.666
When faith

141
00:07:54.666 --> 00:07:57.416
is guided by knowledge and peace,

142
00:07:57.416 --> 00:07:59.208
the atmosphere of the home

143
00:07:59.208 --> 00:08:02.333
begins to rise to a higher level.

144
00:08:02.333 --> 00:08:05.291
Break the chain of fear –

145
00:08:05.291 --> 00:08:10.458
and begin a tradition of the light of knowledge.

146
00:08:15.250 --> 00:08:16.666
At the workplace too,

147
00:08:16.666 --> 00:08:21.166
you are worshipping something or other.

148
00:08:21.166 --> 00:08:22.708
It is not always

149
00:08:22.708 --> 00:08:26.458
in the form of prayer or ritual, but

150
00:08:26.458 --> 00:08:30.208
it shows clearly in your actions –

151
00:08:30.208 --> 00:08:32.583
whom you run after,

152
00:08:32.583 --> 00:08:34.583
before whom you bow,

153
00:08:34.583 --> 00:08:38.583
and what you fear losing the most.

154
00:08:38.583 --> 00:08:41.375
Some people make success a deity,

155
00:08:41.375 --> 00:08:44.833
some make security, some make approval.

156
00:08:44.833 --> 00:08:47.625
And some worship control,

157
00:08:47.625 --> 00:08:49.958
the recognition received from others,

158
00:08:49.958 --> 00:08:52.083
or sheer speed itself.

159
00:08:52.083 --> 00:08:55.875
Now pause and ask yourself –

160
00:08:55.875 --> 00:08:57.916
‘Whom am I

161
00:08:57.916 --> 00:09:01.916
unknowingly worshipping every
day at the workplace?’

162
00:09:01.916 --> 00:09:03.708
Your choices themselves

163
00:09:03.708 --> 00:09:06.916
give the answer to this question.

164
00:09:06.916 --> 00:09:09.708
Just as the different gunas of faith

165
00:09:09.708 --> 00:09:12.750
pull people toward worship of gods,

166
00:09:12.750 --> 00:09:16.416
wealth-guardians, or ghosts and spirits,

167
00:09:16.416 --> 00:09:18.083
in the same way your professional

168
00:09:18.083 --> 00:09:19.083
life too

169
00:09:19.083 --> 00:09:22.083
is a mirror of the tendency within you.

170
00:09:22.083 --> 00:09:24.708
If you remain constantly restless,

171
00:09:24.708 --> 00:09:26.666
bargain with outcomes,

172
00:09:26.666 --> 00:09:30.208
or are driven by ego – then understand that

173
00:09:30.208 --> 00:09:33.125
you are not the only one doing so,

174
00:09:33.125 --> 00:09:36.625
and such a life is never free –

175
00:09:36.625 --> 00:09:38.375
it is bound!

176
00:09:38.375 --> 00:09:40.375
This is why it is necessary

177
00:09:40.375 --> 00:09:43.833
that you bring clarity to your values.

178
00:09:43.833 --> 00:09:47.625
Give respect to those things that lift you higher –

179
00:09:47.625 --> 00:09:49.291
not merely those that impress.

180
00:09:49.291 --> 00:09:52.833
When you bring sattva into your work –

181
00:09:52.833 --> 00:09:55.791
integrity, balance, and purpose –

182
00:09:55.791 --> 00:09:59.583
then your professional life becomes
not only achievement,

183
00:09:59.583 --> 00:10:03.625
but a path of real growth.

184
00:10:03.625 --> 00:10:06.166
Whatever you worship,

185
00:10:06.166 --> 00:10:09.375
you ultimately become like it.

186
00:10:09.375 --> 00:10:13.208
So choose your object of worship carefully –

187
00:10:13.208 --> 00:10:17.125
the one before whom your heart is bowing.

188
00:10:17.125 --> 00:10:19.666
The worship of the right deity

189
00:10:19.666 --> 00:10:20.833
takes the worshipper

190
00:10:20.833 --> 00:10:24.708
to the destination of liberation.

191
00:10:24.708 --> 00:10:25.833
Reflect on this.
